      "text": "How to use:    Switch style to arcgis/imagery (labels+roads bundled)\nData source:   Esri vector tile basemap — roads, places, admin boundaries\nAlternative:   ArcGIS \"Open Basemaps\" (Aug 2025) — Overture + OSM data\nRendering:     MapLibre GL JS + @esri/maplibre-arcgis\nAttribution:   Auto-handled by plugin (required by Esri ToS)",
