      "x": 80,
      "y": 1628,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 105,
      "text": "💰 Pricing (location.arcgis.com/help/billing)\n   Option A — Tile model:     Free 2M tiles/mo → $0.15/1,000 tiles\n   Option B — Session model (recommended ←):\n       Free 1,000 sessions/mo → $4.00/1,000 sessions\n       Session = 12 hours, unlimited tiles\n       Announced Oct 2025 — billed per user visit, not per pan/zoom",
