    {
      "id": "summary_note",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 70,
      "y": 2020,
      "width": 1020,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "Key insights:\n  • Layers 1 & 2 share one ArcGIS session/tile budget — switching from imagery/standard to imagery adds labels at no extra cost\n  • Session model (Oct 2025) is recommended — 12hr unlimited tiles per session, billed per user visit\n  • Layer 3 (NDVI) is the core product differentiator — 100 acres × 4 scans/yr uses only ~0.13 PU of 10,000 free\n  • Layer 4 is entirely free open-source with no external dependencies",
      "fontSize": 13,
